      "summary_en": "Ivern conjures a vine, dealing damage and rooting enemy targets hit. Ivern's allies can dash to the rooted target.",
      "summary_zh": "艾翁召唤出一束荆棘，对命中的敌方单位造成伤害和禁锢效果。艾翁的友军可以突进到禁锢目标附近。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
