      "summary_en": "In brush, Ivern and his nearby allies attacks deal bonus magic damage. Ivern can activate this ability to create a patch of brush.",
      "summary_zh": "在草丛中，艾翁和他附近友军们的攻击将造成额外魔法伤害。艾翁可以激活这个技能来创造一块草丛。",
